  "description": "<strong>This is an event you do not want to miss!</strong>🎲<br>You’re not sitting at a plastic table in a community centre. You’re stepping aboard a hand‑built 17th‑century pirate ship in the heart of London’s Fitzrovia. Candles flicker. Skull glassware gleams. Over 400 rum expressions line the barrel walls. And tonight, the tavern is alive with something darker… and far more fun.<br>This is no ordinary D&amp;D session. Our Games Master, the incredible (@thechaoticgoblin), doesn’t just run the game, they immerses you into the story itself. Alongside your party, you’ll journey through the cursed lands of Vespera, battle terrifying foes, and uncover the long buried secrets of this world.<br><br><strong>The story</strong>🏴‍☠️🪦<br> Deep within the mist-shrouded lands of the Hollow Vale, lies the forgotten town of Morr Hollow. Once a thriving community and sacred pilgrimage site, it now endures as an isolated settlement haunted by the echoes of a fallen age.<br> For the first time in centuries, the bells of Saint Veyre have begun to toll once more. As fear spreads through Morr Hollow, a single rumour passes from trembling lips to listening ears: The Corpse King Rises Again.<br> Called to uncover the truth, adventurers from across Vespera arrive at Morr Hollow only to discover that some things buried beneath the earth were never truly laid to rest.<br> The Rise of the Corpse King: Mysteries of The Hollow Vale is a gothic horror one-shot set in Rathkarah, Rhum Tavern's original homebrew world, created by lead Game Master and writer Alexandria McCauley (@thechaoticgoblin).<br> Step into a land of curses, forgotten history, and ancient horrors where you may discover that the greatest terrors are not always the ones waiting in the darkness, but those within ourselves.<br><br><strong>Production value that breaks the mould</strong>💨<br><strong>Custom-built game board</strong>🔨<br><strong>Immersive lighting &amp; sound</strong>⚡<br><strong>Costumed cast</strong>🕯️<br><strong>Prop interaction</strong>⚰️<br><br><strong>What’s included with your ticket</strong>🎟️<br> All tickets include your seat at the table, character sheet dice, and one welcome grog (rum cocktail or soft drink).<br><br><strong><em>Choose your tier:</em></strong><br><strong>Entry (£25)</strong> – game + participation + welcome grog<br><strong>Intermediate (£35)</strong> – adds 1 stein &amp; shot of grog<br><strong>Hero (£50)</strong> – adds 2 steins &amp; shot + 2 food items from the grill<br><strong>Legend (£100)</strong> – adds 5 steins &amp; shot + 2 food items + Loyalty Coin (30% off all future drinks/food/events at Rhum Tavern)<br><br><strong><em>Doors open at 5:30pm. Game runs 6pm – 10pm.</em></strong><br><strong><em> No experience needed. All levels welcome. Solo players will be matched with a party.</em></strong><br><strong><em> Limited spaces per night – Book in advance to avoid disappointment.</em></strong><br><br><br>",
